公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\Gamma,K,b,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd\\;\\exists\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\Gamma\\times K\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^2\\times K^*)\\;[&amp;A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)\\\\&amp;\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in K\\\\&amp;\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\Gamma\\times K\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^2\\times K^*)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\forall c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall X\\in K\\;\\forall(p,d,\\mathbf e,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,a,c,X)\\;\\alpha\\in\\mathcal U_{K,X}].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\Gamma,K,b,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd\\;\\exists\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\Gamma\\times K\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^2\\times K^*)\\;[&amp;A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)\\\\&amp;\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in K\\\\&amp;\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\Gamma\\times K\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^2\\times K^*)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\forall c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall X\\in K\\;\\forall(p,d,\\mathbf e,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,a,c,X)\\;\\alpha\\in\\mathcal U_{K,X}].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DAPDA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\forall c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall X\\in K\\;|\\delta(q,a,c,X)|\\le1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DAPDA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\forall c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall X\\in K\\;|\\delta(q,a,c,X)|\\le1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>局部动作可改状态、移动输入头、写并移动工作头、压一个字符或弹栈；允许不动。栈顶仍在词左端。与普通 PDA 的区别是只读双向输入和额外有界工作带；栈不计入该工作带界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$A$ 为候选机器。结构判断后固定有效 $A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)$。$\\Gamma$ 为工作带字母表，$K$ 为栈字母表，$b$ 为空白，$\\lhd,\\rhd$ 为只读输入端标记。有限词与幂集见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。$\\mathcal U_{K,X}$ 在断言中给出单次栈动作允许的替换词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\lhd,\\rhd","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_{K,X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathcal U_{K,X}\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon,\\langle X\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{YX:Y\\in K\\}\\quad(X\\in K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{APDA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\Gamma,K,b,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd\\;\\exists\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\Gamma\\times K\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^2\\times K^*)\\;[&A=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,K,b,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd)\\\\&\\land0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in K\\\\&\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\\\&\\land\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\Gamma\\times K\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^2\\times K^*)\\\\&\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\forall c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall X\\in K\\;\\forall(p,d,\\mathbf e,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(q,a,c,X)\\;\\alpha\\in\\mathcal U_{K,X}].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}auxiliary\\text{-}pda\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DAPDA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\forall c\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall X\\in K\\;|\\delta(q,a,c,X)|\\le1","display":true}],"bytes":3046,"backlinks":[{"id":"abf2842401216bb7","anc